@baseUrl = http://localhost:4004

### Suggest similar to existing
POST {{baseUrl}}/search/suggestCustomer
Content-Type: application/json

{ "query": "technology company similar to Nue tech" }

### Suggest for new country
POST {{baseUrl}}/search/suggestCustomer
Content-Type: application/json

{ "query": "create a German engineering company" }

